.TH MOSAIC 1
.SH NAME
mosaic \- the Mosaic password manager on the command line
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mosaic
[GLOBAL OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Mosaic is a zero\-knowledge password manager (pre\-audit). This client opens a vault store directly, never takes a secret from the command line or the environment, and prints a secret only when asked with \fB\-\-reveal\fR.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B mosaic unlock
Unlock with the master password and keep a short session.
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-ttl 5m
Session length: 1 to 30 minutes (default 5m).
.RE
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-password\-stdin
Read the master password from one line of stdin.
.RE
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-password\-fd N
Read the master password from file descriptor N (Unix).
.RE
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-secret\-key\-prompt
Ask for the Secret Key instead of using the keystore.
.RE
.TP
.B mosaic lock
End the session.
.TP
.B mosaic status
Show the store, the session and the sync state.
.TP
.B mosaic list
List items.
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-vault V
Only this vault (name or ID).
.RE
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-type T
Only this item type (login, note, card, ...).
.RE
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-favorites
Only favorites.
.RE
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-trash
Only items in the trash.
.RE
.TP
.B mosaic search QUERY
Search items.
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-vault V
Only this vault (name or ID).
.RE
.TP
.B mosaic get REF
Show an item or one field of it.
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-field F
Print this field only (repeatable).
.RE
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-reveal
Print secret fields (they are concealed by default).
.RE
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-copy
Copy the requested field to the clipboard.
.RE
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-clear\-after 30s
Clear the clipboard after this long (5s to 300s).
.RE
.TP
.B mosaic totp REF
Print the current one\-time code.
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-copy
Copy the code to the clipboard.
.RE
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-clear\-after 30s
Clear the clipboard after this long (5s to 300s).
.RE
.TP
.B mosaic generate
Generate a password or passphrase.
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-length N
Password length.
.RE
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-words N
Make a passphrase of N words.
.RE
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-separator S
Separator between passphrase words.
.RE
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-no\-upper
No uppercase letters.
.RE
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-no\-lower
No lowercase letters.
.RE
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-no\-digits
No digits.
.RE
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-no\-symbols
No symbols.
.RE
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-site DOMAIN
Follow the known password rules of DOMAIN.
.RE
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-copy
Copy the result to the clipboard.
.RE
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-clear\-after 30s
Clear the clipboard after this long (5s to 300s).
.RE
.TP
.B mosaic run \-\- COMMAND [ARGS...]
Run a command with secrets in its environment.
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-env NAME=REF
Set NAME from a reference (repeatable).
.RE
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-env\-file FILE
Read NAME=REF lines from FILE.
.RE
.TP
.B mosaic inject
Fill {{ mosaic://... }} placeholders of a template.
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-in FILE
Template to read (default: stdin).
.RE
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-out FILE
Write the result to FILE (mode 0600, never overwrites).
.RE
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-reveal
Allow secrets on a terminal.
.RE
.TP
.B mosaic ssh list|public\-key|agent\-status [REF]
List SSH keys, print a public key, or explain the agent.
.TP
.B mosaic import enpass|bitwarden|keepass|1password|cxf|csv|mosaicx FILE
Import a file from another password manager or a Mosaic export.
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-vault V
Import into this vault (name or ID).
.RE
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-dry\-run
Show the preview and import nothing.
.RE
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-file\-password\-prompt
Ask for the file's password (KeePass).
.RE
.TP
.B mosaic export FILE
Write an encrypted export file.
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-vault V
Export only this vault (repeatable).
.RE
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-include\-attachments
Include attachment contents.
.RE
.TP
.B mosaic sync
Sync once with the store's backend.
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-status
Show the sync state and findings; do not sync.
.RE
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-acknowledge
Show the findings and clear them after you type the word.
.RE
.TP
.B mosaic setup own\-store
Give the CLI its own device store.
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-folder PATH
Join over this sync folder.
.RE
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-server URL
Join over this server.
.RE
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-email E
The sync account's email.
.RE
.TP
.B mosaic recover
Recover after a password or key change made elsewhere.
.TP
.B mosaic completions bash|zsh|fish|powershell
Print a shell completion script.
.TP
.B mosaic help [COMMAND]
Show help or the manual page.
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-man
Print the manual page (roff).
.RE
.SH GLOBAL OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-store PATH
Use the vault store at PATH (also MOSAIC_STORE).
.TP
.B \-\-profile shared|own
shared: the desktop app's store (default). own: the CLI's own device.
.TP
.B \-\-json
Print one JSON document ({"v":1,...}) instead of text.
.TP
.B \-\-lang en|de
Message language (also MOSAIC_LANG, LANG).
.TP
.B \-\-no\-input
Never prompt; a needed prompt is exit 3.
.TP
.B \-\-quiet
Print only the requested value.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 ok; 1 other error; 2 usage; 3 authentication failed or input required; 4 not found; 5 store in use; 6 sync halted or sync error; 7 ambiguous reference; 8 vault part locked; 9 reveal required; 10 rotation in progress; 125 the command of \fBrun\fR could not start; 130 interrupted.
.SH SEE ALSO
docs/CLI.md
